  "story": {
    "day": 129,
    "title": "Kaya's Alaska Dream",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya had homework about Alaska.",
      "Her idea was a journey to see the aurora.",
      "She saw wild wolves in the cold weather.",
      "She wanted to travel safely by plane on this trip.",
      "During her fourth hour online, she drank barley tea.",
      "Then she ate half a snack, getting a headache.",
      "She heard laughter loudly outside her window.",
      "An elderly actor and director discussed coffee.",
      "Kaya finally bought a forty-dollar shirt on sale.",
      "She planned to sell her old tablet.",
      "Leaving litter near an olive tree felt wrong; it was a problem.",
      "She would carefully pick it up. This culture should belong. Don't break it. She imagined a wolf's smell and sending greetings in a letter."
    ]
  }
}